  │ [38;5;153monChange[39m fires on a [38;5;153mstorage[39m event                            │ Cross-tab sync                │
  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┴───────────────────────────────┘

  Not covered, deliberately: the DOM submit handler and the logout button. Testing those needs jsdom or a browser
  driver, which reintroduces the dependency and the setup you declined. The logic worth protecting lives in [38;5;153msession.js[39m
  and is fully covered; the handler stays thin enough to read.

